if ok && !entry.Loading {
    return entry.Value, nil
}
```

Reading `c.data` and `entry.Loading` without locks. Data race with any writer.

### 7. MEDIUM: Cache Stampede on Load Failure (Lines 69-74)

When loading fails, you delete the entry:
```go
