```

Other goroutines in `waitForLoad()` will never see completion. They'll either:
- Spin forever (until context cancels)
- Miss the error entirely and try loading again

### 8. MEDIUM: Size() and GetStats() Unprotected (Lines 137-145)

Both read shared state without locks. Data races, but less likely to panic.

### 9. MEDIUM: Refresh() and LoadOrStore() Unprotected (Lines 148-175)

Both bypass all locking. Full data races on every operation.

